  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study of India&#x2019;s fiscal issues for 16th Finance Commission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will commission study to reflect upon the terms of reference of the 16th Finance Commission with respect to the stake of the Indian States. The study will help to develop evidence validated by statistics and discussion to provide recommendations which support public finance management. This will help to improve revenue management capability, expenditure behaviour and better debt management at the State level in India.</narrative>
  </description>
